{"unit_id":"kaijia323__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-safe-area","repo":"kaijia323/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"44b16a40d3ddcc9a04a088cf7ab158c60be7c4e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「手机安全区适配」：为移动抽屉、对话头栏、面板、弹窗和输入区增加刘海及 home indicator 留白。手机视口标记启用后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:55-103","client.js:211-252"]}
{"unit_id":"kaijia323__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-terminal-keys","repo":"kaijia323/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"44b16a40d3ddcc9a04a088cf7ab158c60be7c4e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「终端快捷键」：在手机终端底部显示 Esc、Tab、方向键和 Ctrl 按键。点击按键向终端输入区派发对应键盘事件，Ctrl 可先开启再输入字母。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:501-615"]}
{"unit_id":"kaijia323__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-touch-reorder","repo":"kaijia323/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"44b16a40d3ddcc9a04a088cf7ab158c60be7c4e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「触屏长按排序」：对可拖动项目提供静止长按后拖动排序。触点移动或滚动会取消等待，拖动完成后交给页面原有排序处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:617-816"]}
{"unit_id":"kaijia323__dsh-mobile-ui#feature-focus-reveal","repo":"kaijia323/dsh-mobile-ui","commit":"44b16a40d3ddcc9a04a088cf7ab158c60be7c4e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-ui 的功能「输入框聚焦恢复」：手机上聚焦到 composer 之外的输入框后，若软键盘遮住输入框，会在短暂等待后将其滚动到可见区域。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:469-499"]}
